{"unit_id":"Stylelinzzz__dsh-chat-history#feature-1","repo":"Stylelinzzz/dsh-chat-history","commit":"d9e31fb261318b2008a97d92cd528e97c5c92225","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-chat-history 的功能「用户消息目录」：把当前会话中有文本内容的 user 消息整理为按会话顺序排列的标题列表，标题最长保留 48 个字符。打开 History 视图即可浏览并点击条目。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:74-105","lib/client.js:254-268"]}
{"unit_id":"Stylelinzzz__dsh-chat-history#feature-2","repo":"Stylelinzzz/dsh-chat-history","commit":"d9e31fb261318b2008a97d92cd528e97c5c92225","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-chat-history 的功能「自动补载历史」：History 面板根据 hasMore 和 loadingOlder 状态逐页请求更早的会话记录，每次加载由会话控制，并设有最多 200 页的上限。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:42-43","lib/client.js:122-134","lib/client.js:260-266"]}
{"unit_id":"Stylelinzzz__dsh-chat-history#feature-3","repo":"Stylelinzzz/dsh-chat-history","commit":"d9e31fb261318b2008a97d92cd528e97c5c92225","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-chat-history 的功能「定位历史消息」：点击目录中的条目后切回 Chat 视图，按消息节点键寻找对应的页面元素，平滑滚动到该消息并短暂添加高亮。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:135-153","lib/client.js:194-203"]}
{"unit_id":"Stylelinzzz__dsh-chat-history#feature-4","repo":"Stylelinzzz/dsh-chat-history","commit":"d9e31fb261318b2008a97d92cd528e97c5c92225","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-chat-history 的功能「新旧数据布局兼容」：根据是否提供 useChat hook 选择当前或旧版数据读取方式，并分别使用 openView 或点击 Chat 标签返回聊天视图。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:194-240"]}
